# reject-guard-pairing-reversibility — `contains` is the membership operator for
# `tags` alone. An ordered property admits only `>=` and `=`; an invalid
# (field, op) pairing parses and is rejected at apply (§6).
actor bot7
gate  act risk low grant bot7
reserve deploy by safety when reversibility contains irreversible
cord bot7 -> act
cord act  -> master
